  "description": "Winnovative PDF Security Library for .NET (Classic) can be used in .NET Framework, .NET Core and .NET Standard applications on Windows to manage the security settings of PDF documents.\n\nFor Windows, Linux and macOS, the Core PDF API of Winnovative PDF Next creates, edits, merges and secures PDF documents. It comes in the multi-platform package Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Core and the platform packages Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Core.Windows (x64 and ARM64), Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Core.Linux (x64 and ARM64) and Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Core.MacOS (ARM64).\n\nThe full Winnovative PDF Next library, which also converts HTML, Word, Excel, RTF and Markdown to PDF, comes in the Winnovative.Pdf.Next, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Windows, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Windows.Arm64, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Linux, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Linux.Arm64 and Winnovative.Pdf.Next.MacOS packages.\n\nCompatibility:\n\n* .NET Framework 4.0 and above\n* .NET 10, 9, 8, 7, 6 and .NET Standard 2.0\n* Windows platforms\n* Azure App Service\n* Azure Cloud Services and Azure Virtual Machines\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications\n\nMain Features:\n\n* Secure PDF documents from files and streams\n* Save secured documents in memory or to files\n* Set user and owner passwords\n* Encrypt PDF document content\n* Support AES and RC4 encryption algorithms\n* Support 40, 128 and 256-bit encryption keys\n* Set PDF document permissions (print, edit, copy)\n* Remove PDF document security settings using a user or owner password",
